; Water atom types for the CHARMM TIP3 model.
; charmm36.itp as exported by CHARMM-GUI Ligand Reader carries only the
; types the uploaded molecule needs, so OT and HT are missing and the water
; topology cannot be read. These two lines supply them.

[ atomtypes ]
      HT     1     1.0080      0.417     A    4.00013524445e-02    1.924640e-01 
      OT     8    15.9994     -0.834     A    3.15057422683e-01    6.363864e-01 
